<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"><TXSPN>-sama, the condition for the third route of the Shigatsu Arc [Death Month] has been met.<PG>
I believe you understand what has changed, but just how will it affect things from here on?<PG>
I would like to guide you there now.<PG>
Note that the Shigatsu Arc [Death Month] ends with the next route. Please watch closely to see whether it leads straight to their happy ending.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
